facet.library/ResetFences                            facet.library/ResetFences

   NAME
	ResetFences -- Fences back to unsignalled.

   SYNOPSIS
	    fn ResetFences(base: *FacetBase, device: *facet.Device, count: u32, fences: [*]const *facet.Fence) facet.Result

   SINCE
	1.0. LVO -184.

